@startuml

[*] --> AddNewGoods
state "Add New Goods" as AddNewGoods
AddNewGoods : entry / user adds new goods to inventory
AddNewGoods : do / update inventory list
AddNewGoods : exit / add successful

state UpdatePrice <<choice>>
AddNewGoods --> UpdatePrice

state "Update Price" as UpdatePrice
UpdatePrice : entry / select item to update price
UpdatePrice : do / update price in database
UpdatePrice : exit / price updated

state RemoveGoods <<choice>>
AddNewGoods --> RemoveGoods

state "Remove Goods" as RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods : entry / user removes goods from inventory
RemoveGoods : do / remove from inventory list
RemoveGoods : exit / remove successful

state ExpiredGoods <<choice>>
UpdatePrice --> ExpiredGoods
RemoveGoods --> ExpiredGoods

state "Expired Goods" as ExpiredGoods
ExpiredGoods : entry / identify expired goods
ExpiredGoods : do / notify user of removal
ExpiredGoods : exit / expired goods removed

state PlaceOrder <<choice>>
RemoveGoods --> PlaceOrder

state "Place Order" as PlaceOrder
PlaceOrder : entry / place order with supplier
PlaceOrder : do / generate invoice for order
PlaceOrder : exit / order placed

state SearchItems <<choice>>
PlaceOrder --> SearchItems

state "Search Items" as SearchItems
SearchItems : entry / search inventory for items
SearchItems : do / select items for purchase
SearchItems : exit / items selected

state CalculateDiscountTax <<choice>>
SearchItems --> CalculateDiscountTax

state "Calculate Discount Tax" as CalculateDiscountTax
CalculateDiscountTax : entry / calculate discount and tax
CalculateDiscountTax : do / apply to total cost
CalculateDiscountTax : exit / total calculated

state GenerateReceipt <<choice>>
CalculateDiscountTax --> GenerateReceipt

state "Generate Receipt" as GenerateReceipt
GenerateReceipt : entry / generate receipt for customer
GenerateReceipt : do / print or email receipt
GenerateReceipt : exit / receipt generated

state ReplaceItemCancelReceipt <<choice>>
GenerateReceipt --> ReplaceItemCancelReceipt

state "Replace Item Cancel Receipt" as ReplaceItemCancelReceipt
ReplaceItemCancelReceipt : entry / replace item or cancel receipt
ReplaceItemCancelReceipt : do / update inventory and customer records
ReplaceItemCancelReceipt : exit / replacement or cancellation successful

state RecordCustomerRequests <<choice>>
ReplaceItemCancelReceipt --> RecordCustomerRequests

state "Record Customer Requests" as RecordCustomerRequests
RecordCustomerRequests : entry / record customer requests for items
RecordCustomerRequests : do / notify customer of availability
RecordCustomerRequests : exit / request recorded

state ViewTransactionSummary <<choice>>
RecordCustomerRequests --> ViewTransactionSummary

state "View Transaction Summary" as ViewTransactionSummary
ViewTransactionSummary : entry / view summary report of transactions
ViewTransactionSummary : do / display transaction history
ViewTransactionSummary : exit / summary viewed

[*] --> ViewTransactionSummary

@enduml
